-4\" /> },\n    { id: 'logout', label: 'Déconnexion', icon: <LogOut className=\"h-4 w-4\" /> }\n  ];\n\n  const criteriaLabels = {\n    quality: 'Qualité produit',\n    delivery: 'Respect délais',\n    service: 'Service client',\n    value: 'Rapport qualité/prix'\n  };\n\n  const openEvaluationModal = (product: any) => {\n    setSelectedProduct(product);\n    setShowEvaluationModal(true);\n    setRating(0);\n    setCriteriaRatings({ quality: 0, delivery: 0, service: 0, value: 0 });\n    setComment('');\n    setWouldRecommend(null);\n  };\n\n  const handleSubmitEvaluation = (e: React.FormEvent) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    console.log('Évaluation soumise:', {\n      product: selectedProduct,\n      rating,\n      criteriaRatings,\n      comment,\n      wouldRecommend\n    });\n    setShowEvaluationModal(false);\n  };\n\n  const renderStars = (currentRating: number, interactive: boolean = false, onRate?: (rating: number) => void) => {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"flex gap-1\">\n        {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map((star) => (\n          <Star\n            key={star}\n            className={`h-5 w-5 ${\n              star <= currentRating \n                ? 'text-yellow-400 fill-current' \n                : 'text-gray-300'\n            } ${interactive ? 'cursor-pointer hover:text-yellow-400' : ''}`}\n            onClick={interactive && onRate ? () => onRate(star) : undefined}\n          />\n        ))}\n      </div>\n    );\n  };\n\n  const renderSmallStars = (rating: number) => {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"flex gap-1\">\n        {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map((star) => (\n          <Star\n            key={star}\n            className={`h-3 w-3 ${\n              star <= rating ? 'text-yellow-400 fill-current' : 'text-gray-300'\n            }`}\n          />\n        ))}\n      </div>\n    );\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"min-h-screen bg-gray-50\">\n      {/* Header identique */}\n      <div className=\"bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-sm py-2\">\n        <div className=\"container mx-auto px-4 flex justify-between items-center\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span className=\"text-gray-600\">📞</span>\n            <span>Nous sommes disponibles 24h/7j, Besoin d'aide ?</span>\n            <span className=\"text-green-600 font-semibold\">+221 77 123 45 67</span>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-4 text-sm\">\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:text-green-600\">À Propos</a>\n            <span className=\"text-gray-400\">|</span>\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:text-green-600\">Nous Contacter</a>\n            <span className=\"text-gray-400\">|</span>\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:text-green-600\">Mon Compte</a>\n            <span className=\"text-gray-400\">|</span>\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:text-green-600 flex items-center gap-1\">\n              🔒 Déconnexion\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"bg-matix-green-dark text-white py-4\">\n        <div className=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <Link href=\"/\" className=\"flex items-center\">\n              <div className=\"bg-white text-matix-green-dark p-2 rounded-lg mr-3\">\n                <svg className=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n                  <path d=\"M3 1a1 1 0 000 2h1.22l.305 1.222a.997.997 0 00.01.042l1.358 5.43-.893.892C3.74 11.846 4.632 14 6.414 14H15a1 1 0 000-2H6.414l1-1H14a1 1 0 00.894-.553l3-6A1 1 0 0017 3H6.28l-.31-1.243A1 1 0 005 1H3zM16 16.5a1.5 1.5 0 11-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 013 0zM6.5 18a1.5 1.5 0 100-3 1.5 1.5 0 000 3z\"/>\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <h1 className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-matix-yellow\">MATIX</h1>\n                <p className=\"text-xs text-matix-yellow opacity-90\">M A R T</p>\n              </div>\n            </Link>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"bg-white border-b border-gray-200 py-3\">\n        <div className=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n          <nav className=\"flex items-center space-x-8\">\n            <Link href=\"/\" className=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-matix-green-medium font-medium\">Accueil</Link>\n            <Link href=\"/categories\" className=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-matix-green-medium font-medium\">Catégories</Link>\n            <Link href=\"#\" className=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-matix-green-medium font-medium\">À Propos</Link>\n            <Link href=\"#\" className=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-matix-green-medium font-medium\">Contact</Link>\n            <Link href=\"/offres\" className=\"text-matix-yellow font-medium\">Offres</Link>\n          </nav>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Main Content */}\n      <div className=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-8\">\n        <div className=\"grid lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n          {/* Sidebar */}\n          <div className=\"lg:col-span-1\">\n            <Card className=\"p-6\">\n              {/* Profile Section */}\n              <div className=\"text-center mb-6\">\n                <div className=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full overflow-hidden mx-auto mb-3\">\n                  <img \n                    src={user.avatar} \n                    alt={user.name}\n                    className=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"\n                  />\n                </div>\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">{user.name}</h3>\n                <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">{user.email}</p>\n                <p className=\"text-xs text-purple-600\">Client</p>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Menu Navigation */}\n              <nav className=\"space-y-1\">\n                {menuItems.map((item) => (\n                  <Link\n                    key={item.id}\n                    href={item.id === 'dashboard' ? '/dashboard/client' : `/dashboard/client/${item.id}`}\n                    className={`w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-left transition-colors ${\n                      activePage === item.id \n                        ? 'bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 font-medium' \n                        : 'text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50 hover:text-purple-600'\n                    }`}\n                  >\n                    {item.icon}\n                    <span className=\"text-sm\">{item.label}</span>\n                  </Link>\n                ))}\n              </nav>\n            </Card>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Main Content */}\n          <div className=\"lg:col-span-3\">\n            <div className=\"mb-6\">\n              <h1 className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Historique & Mes Évaluations</h1>\n              <p className=\"text-gray-600\">Évaluez vos achats et suivez vos vendeurs préférés</p>\n            </div>\n\n            {/* Onglets */}\n            <div className=\"mb-6\">\n              <div className=\"flex border-b border-gray-200\">\n                <button\n                  className={`px-6 py-3 font-medium text-sm ${\n                    activeTab === 'to-review'\n                      ? 'border-b-2 border-purple-600 text-purple-600'\n                      : 'text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700'\n                  }`}\n                  onClick={() => setActiveTab('to-review')}\n                >\n                  À Évaluer ({productsToReview.length})\n                </button>\n                <button\n                  className={`px-6 py-3 font-medium text-sm ${\n                    activeTab === 'given-reviews'\n                      ? 'border-b-2 border-purple-600 text-purple-600'\n                      : 'text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700'\n                  }`}\n                  onClick={() => setActiveTab('given-reviews')}\n                >\n                  Évaluations Données ({givenReviews.length})\n                </button>\n                <button\n                  className={`px-6 py-3 font-medium text-sm ${\n                    activeTab === 'followed-vendors'\n                      ? 'border-b-2 border-purple-600 text-purple-600'\n                      : 'text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700'\n                  }`}\n                  onClick={() => setActiveTab('followed-vendors')}\n                >\n                  Vendeurs Suivis ({followedVendors.length})\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            {/* Contenu des onglets */}\n            {activeTab === 'to-review' && (\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n                {productsToReview.map((product) => (\n                  <Card key={product.id} className=\"p-4\">\n                    <div className=\"aspect-square mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg\">\n                      <img \n                        src={product.image} \n                        alt={product.name}\n                        className=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"\n                      />\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-1 line-clamp-2\">{product.name}</h3>\n                    <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1\">Vendeur: {product.vendor}</p>\n                    <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1\">Acheté le: {product.purchaseDate}</p>\n                    <p className=\"text-xs text-purple-600 font-medium mb-3\">{product.price}</p>\n                    <Button \n                      className=\"w-full bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white text-sm\"\n                      onClick={() => openEvaluationModal(product)}\n                    >\n                      Évaluer Maintenant\n                    </Button>\n                  </Card>\n                ))}\n              </div>\n            )}\n\n            {activeTab === 'given-reviews' && (\n              <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n                {givenReviews.map((review) => (\n                  <Card key={review.id} className=\"p-6\">\n                    <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n                      <img \n                        src={review.image} \n                        alt={review.product}\n                        className=\"w-16 h-16 object-cover rounded-lg\"\n                      />\n                      <div className=\"flex-1\">\n                        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\">\n                          <div>\n                            <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">{review.product}</h3>\n                            <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Vendeur: {review.vendor}</p>\n                          </div>\n                          <div className=\"text-right\">\n                            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1\">\n                              {renderSmallStars(review.rating)}\n                              <span className=\"text-sm font-medium\">{review.rating}/5</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">{review.date}</p>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <p className=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">{review.comment}</p>\n                        \n                        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-3\">\n                          {Object.entries(review.criteria).map(([key, value]) => (\n                            <div key={key} className=\"text-center\">\n                              <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1\">\n                                {criteriaLabels[key as keyof typeof criteriaLabels]}\n                              </p>\n                              <div className=\"flex justify-center\">\n                                {renderSmallStars(value)}\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          ))}\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div className=\"flex gap-2\">\n                          <Button variant=\"outline\" size=\"sm\" className=\"text-purple-600 border-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-50\">\n                            <Edit className=\"h-3 w-3 mr-1\" />\n                            Modifier\n                          </Button>\n                          <Button variant=\"outline\" size=\"sm\" className=\"text-blue-600 border-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-50\">\n                            <Eye className=\"h-3 w-3 mr-1\" />\n                            Voir détails\n                          </Button>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </Card>\n                ))}\n              </div>\n            )}\n\n            {activeTab === 'followed-vendors' && (\n              <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n                {followedVendors.map((vendor) => (\n                  <Card key={vendor.id} className=\"p-6\">\n                    <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                      <div className=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <img \n                          src={vendor.avatar} \n                          alt={vendor.name}\n                          className=\"w-16 h-16 object-cover rounded-full\"\n                        />\n                        <div>\n                          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1\">\n                            <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">{vendor.name}</h3>\n                            {vendor.newProducts > 0 && (\n                              <span className=\"bg-red-500 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded-full text-xs\">\n                                {vendor.newProducts} nouveau{vendor.newProducts > 1 ? 'x' : ''}\n                              </span>\n                            )}\n                          </div>\n                          <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">{vendor.specialty}</p>\n                          <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">{vendor.location}</p>\n                          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1\">\n                            {renderSmallStars(vendor.rating)}\n                            <span className=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">({vendor.rating})</span>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      \n                      <div className=\"text-right\">\n                        <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-1\">\n                          {vendor.totalPurchases} achat{vendor.totalPurchases > 1 ? 's' : ''}\n                        </p>\n                        <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-3\">\n                          Dernier: {vendor.lastPurchase}\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        <div className=\"flex gap-2\">\n                          <Button variant=\"outline\" size=\"sm\" className=\"text-blue-600 border-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-50\">\n                            <Store className=\"h-3 w-3 mr-1\" />\n                            Boutique\n                          </Button>\n                          <Button variant=\"outline\" size=\"sm\" className=\"text-green-600 border-green-600 hover:bg-green-50\">\n                            <Phone className=\"h-3 w-3 mr-1\" />\n                            Contacter\n                          </Button>\n                          <Button variant=\"outline\" size=\"sm\" className=\"text-red-600 border-red-600 hover:bg-red-50\">\n                            <UserMinus className=\"h-3 w-3 mr-1\" />\n                            Se désabonner\n                          </Button>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-2\">\n                          <Bell className={`h-4 w-4 ${vendor.notifications ? 'text-purple-600' : 'text-gray-400'}`} />\n                          <span className=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">\n                            Notifications {vendor.notifications ? 'activées' : 'désactivées'}\n                          </span>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </Card>\n                ))}\n              </div>\n            )}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Modal Évaluation */}\n      {showEvaluationModal && selectedProduct && (\n        <div className=\"fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n          <div className=\"bg-white rounded-lg max-w-md w-full max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto\">\n            <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between p-6 border-b\">\n              <h3 className=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Évaluer {selectedProduct.name}</h3>\n              <Button\n                variant=\"ghost\"\n                size=\"sm\"\n                onClick={() => setShowEvaluationModal(false)}\n              >\n                <X className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n              </Button>\n            </div>\n\n            <form onSubmit={handleSubmitEvaluation} className=\"p-6 space-y-6\">\n              {/* Produit Info */}\n              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3\">\n                <img \n                  src={selectedProduct.image} \n                  alt={selectedProduct.name}\n                  className=\"w-12 h-12 object-cover rounded-lg\"\n                />\n                <div>\n                  <p className=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">{selectedProduct.name}</p>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Vendeur: {selectedProduct.vendor}</p>\n                  <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Acheté le: {selectedProduct.purchaseDate}</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Note générale */}\n              <div>\n                <label className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-3\">\n                  Note générale\n                </label>\n                {renderStars(rating, true, setRating)}\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Critères détaillés */}\n              <div>\n                <label className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-3\">\n                  Évaluation détaillée\n                </label>\n                <div className=\"space-y-3\">\n                  {Object.entries(criteriaLabels).map(([key, label]) => (\n                    <div key={key} className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                      <span className=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">{label}</span>\n                      <div className=\"flex gap-1\">\n                        {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map((star) => (\n                          <Star\n                            key={star}\n                            className={`h-4 w-4 cursor-pointer ${\n                              star <= criteriaRatings[key as keyof typeof criteriaRatings]\n                                ? 'text-yellow-400 fill-current' \n                                : 'text-gray-300 hover:text-yellow-400'\n                            }`}\n                            onClick={() => setCriteriaRatings({\n                              ...criteriaRatings,\n                              [key]: star\n                            })}\n                          />\n                        ))}\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  ))}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Commentaire */}\n              <div>\n                <label className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2\">\n                  Votre commentaire\n                </label>\n                <textarea\n                  className=\"w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 h-24 resize-none\"\n                  value={comment}\n                  onChange={(e) => setComment(e.target.value)}\n                  placeholder=\"Partagez votre expérience avec ce produit et ce vendeur...\"\n                  required\n                />\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Upload photos */}\n              <div>\n                <label className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2\">\n                  Photos (optionnel)\n                </label>\n                <div className=\"border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 rounded-lg p-4 text-center\">\n                  <Camera className=\"h-6 w-6 text-gray-400 mx-auto mb-2\" />\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Ajoutez des photos de votre achat</p>\n                  <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">PNG, JPG jusqu'à 5MB</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Recommandation */}\n              <div>\n                <label className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-3\">\n                  Recommanderiez-vous ce vendeur ?\n                </label>\n                <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n                  <button\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    onClick={() => setWouldRecommend(true)}\n                    className={`flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border transition-colors ${\n                      wouldRecommend === true\n                        ? 'bg-green-100 border-green-500 text-green-700'\n                        : 'border-gray-300 text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50'\n                    }`}\n                  >\n                    <ThumbsUp className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n                    Oui\n                  </button>\n                  <button\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    onClick={() => setWouldRecommend(false)}\n                    className={`flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border transition-colors ${\n                      wouldRecommend === false\n                        ? 'bg-red-100 border-red-500 text-red-700'\n                        : 'border-gray-300 text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50'\n                    }`}\n                  >\n                    <ThumbsDown className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n                    Non\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"flex gap-3 pt-4\">\n                <Button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  variant=\"outline\"\n                  className=\"flex-1\"\n                  onClick={() => setShowEvaluationModal(false)}\n                >\n                  Annuler\n                </Button>\n                <Button\n                  type=\"submit\"\n                  className=\"flex-1 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white\"\n                  disabled={rating === 0 || !comment.trim()}\n                >\n                  Publier Évaluation\n                </Button>\n              </div>\n            </form>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Section App */}\n      <div className=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-blue-50 py-16\">\n        <div className=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n            <div className=\"text-center lg:text-left\">\n              <div className=\"text-6xl mb-4\">📱</div>\n              <h3 className=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">\n                Obtenez Vos Besoins Quotidiens Depuis Notre Boutique Matix\n              </h3>\n              <p className=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 text-lg\">\n                Il y a de nombreux produits que vous trouverez dans notre boutique. \n                Choisissez votre produit nécessaire quotidien dans notre boutique Matix \n                et obtenez des offres spéciales.\n              </p>\n              <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center lg:justify-start\">\n                <Button className=\"bg-black hover:bg-gray-800 text-white flex items-center gap-2\">\n                  <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/Google_Play_Store_badge_EN.svg\" alt=\"Google Play\" className=\"h-6\" />\n                  Google Play\n                </Button>\n                <Button className=\"bg-black hover:bg-gray-800 text-white flex items-center gap-2\">\n                  <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/Download_on_the_App_Store_Badge.svg\" alt=\"App Store\" className=\"h-6\" />\n                  App Store\n                </Button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"text-center\">\n              <div className=\"text-8xl\">🛒</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Features Bar */}\n      <div className=\"bg-white py-8\">\n        <div className=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n              <div className=\"bg-green-100 p-3 rounded-full\">\n                <svg className=\"h-6 w-6 text-green-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <div className=\"font-semibold\">Livraison Gratuite</div>\n                <div className=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">À partir de 50,000 FCFA</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n              <div className=\"bg-green-100 p-3 rounded-full\">\n                <svg className=\"h-6 w-6 text-green-600\" fill=\"none